@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed explicit source review, draft save and separate publication
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Open intended resume and explicit content language;
:Review source differences against exact draft/source versions;\nshow affected selections and overrides;
:Select intended changes;
if (Current authority and versions valid?) then (yes)
 :Apply only selected changes;\nshow Saved Draft and unchanged Published Revision;
else (denied / stale)
 :Safe refusal or conflict review;\npreserve permitted intended edits;
 stop
endif
if (Owner explicitly chooses Publish?) then (yes)
 :Review intended candidate / language / consequences;\nseparate confirmation;
 :Resolve actual publication outcome;\nshow exact published revision or accurate conflict / pending state;
else (no)
 :Continue editing; publication remains unchanged;
endif
note right
 Actual submitted material remains independent.
 Publication does not prove a PDF is available.
end note
stop
@enduml
